{%- comment -%} Formats an amount (in cents) honouring the "Show currency codes" setting. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} Wrapped in U+2066/U+2069 (left-to-right isolate) so prices keep their order inside Arabic text. {%- endcomment -%}
